        "byte_range": [
          49917,
          50167
        ],
        "text_sha256": "df442582d663b0e260423cbe8216b6a1f5cd2e046979778ce3d3ccc2f0ef343f"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n寺院普通劳务；找人调动书摊、车脚、渡口、小店。每个人只给模糊线索。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
