        "text_sha256": "e046fdccc95aec8e61e37820cec4ad06726b3039d65d6e04b111032a006a80a9"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n人生论文、佛理总结、精神胜利叙述、“终于看破宝钗黛玉”、玉触发、神谕。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
